  triage:title "Local-IPC helper thread leaks on read timeout" ;
  triage:description "rust-service-hardening-agent (AI43-QA-1) found that in crates/atm-daemon-client/src/http_exchange.rs, the local-IPC helper thread is not joined/cancelled on a read timeout and leaks. Flagged as pre-existing (AI.43 only swapped the inner read call) rather than introduced by this diff, but it is a real open resource-leak defect and must be fixed, not deferred on that basis." ;
